{"seq":3,"slug":"merge-and-rebase","title":"合并与变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/merge-and-rebase","wordCount":911,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"合并与变基\">合并与变基</h1><h2 id=\"三种整合策略概览\">三种整合策略概览</h2><p>将一个分支的更改整合到另一个分支，Git 提供三种主要策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>历史形态</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Merge</td>\n<td><code>git merge feature</code></td>\n<td>保留分支拓扑</td>\n<td>团队协作，保留完整历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rebase</td>\n<td><code>git rebase main</code></td>\n<td>线性历史</td>\n<td>个人分支整理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Squash</td>\n<td><code>git merge --squash feature</code></td>\n<td>压缩为单次提交</td>\n<td>功能分支合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>整合分支的三条路径，本质上是在<strong>历史可读性</strong>与<strong>历史真实性</strong>之间做取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快进合并</td>\n<td>目标分支无新提交时直接移动指针，不产生合并提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三路合并</td>\n<td>比较 base、ours、theirs 后生成合并提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变基</td>\n<td>重放提交到新基底，生成新 SHA-1，换取线性历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩合并</td>\n<td>将功能分支的多个提交折叠为单个提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄金法则</td>\n<td>不对已推送的公共提交做变基</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fast-forward-与三路合并\">Fast-Forward 与三路合并</h2><p>当目标分支没有新提交时，Git 执行 <strong>Fast-Forward（快进）合并</strong>，直接移动分支指针：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout main&#10;git merge feature\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;B&quot;&#10;    branch feature&#10;    commit id: &quot;C&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;D&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    merge feature id: &quot;FF&quot; type: NORMAL\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A\"\n    commit id: \"B\"\n    branch feature\n    commit id: \"C\"\n    commit id: \"D\"\n    checkout main\n    merge feature id: \"FF\" type: NORMAL</pre><p>当两个分支都有新提交时，Git 执行<strong>三路合并（Three-Way Merge）</strong>，创建一个新的合并 commit：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout main&#10;git merge feature --no-ff&#10;&#10;git log --oneline --graph\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --no-ff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合并类型</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fast-Forward</td>\n<td>目标分支无新提交</td>\n<td>指针前移，无合并 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Three-Way</td>\n<td>两分支都有新提交</td>\n<td>创建合并 commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--no-ff</code></td>\n<td>强制三路合并</td>\n<td>始终创建合并 commit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>--no-ff</code> 可以在历史中保留功能分支的起止信息，便于后续追溯。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>三路合并的名称来源于它使用三个版本进行比较：两个分支的最新 commit（ours 和 theirs），以及它们的最近公共祖先（base）。Git 对比 base 与 ours 的差异、base 与 theirs 的差异，然后尝试自动合并两组变更。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rebase-变基\">Rebase 变基</h2><p><strong>变基（Rebase）</strong> 将当前分支的提交&quot;重放&quot;到目标分支之上，生成全新的 commit（新的 SHA-1），从而获得线性历史。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout feature&#10;git rebase main&#10;&#10;git log --oneline --graph\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 变基前&#10;        A1[A] --&gt; B1[B] --&gt; E1[E]&#10;        B1 --&gt; C1[C] --&gt; D1[D]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 变基后&#10;        A2[A] --&gt; B2[B] --&gt; E2[E] --&gt; C2[&quot;C&#39;&quot;] --&gt; D2[&quot;D&#39;&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 变基前\n        A1[A] --&gt; B1[B] --&gt; E1[E]\n        B1 --&gt; C1[C] --&gt; D1[D]\n    end\n    subgraph 变基后\n        A2[A] --&gt; B2[B] --&gt; E2[E] --&gt; C2[\"C'\"] --&gt; D2[\"D'\"]\n    end</pre><p><strong>黄金法则</strong>：永远不要对已经推送到公共仓库的提交执行 rebase，这会改变已有的历史，导致其他协作者的基底失效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase main&#10;git rebase --abort&#10;git rebase --continue&#10;git rebase --skip\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --abort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --skip</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交互式-rebase\">交互式 Rebase</h3><p>交互式 rebase 允许你在变基过程中编辑、合并或重排 commit，是整理本地提交历史的利器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git rebase -i HEAD~5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD~5</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在打开的编辑器中，每行一个 commit，可选操作包括 <code>pick</code>（保留）、<code>squash</code>（合并到前一个）、<code>edit</code>（暂停以修改）、<code>drop</code>（丢弃）和 <code>reword</code>（修改提交消息）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"squash-合并\">Squash 合并</h2><p><strong>Squash 合并</strong>将功能分支的所有提交压缩为一个 commit 合入目标分支：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout main&#10;git merge --squash feature&#10;git commit -m &quot;feat: add user authentication module&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --squash</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add user authentication module\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>merge</th>\n<th>rebase</th>\n<th>squash merge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>历史形态</td>\n<td>非线性，有分叉</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>线性，一个提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始提交</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>重写</td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并 commit</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可追溯性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退难度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"冲突解决\">冲突解决</h2><p>当两个分支修改了同一文件的同一区域，Git 无法自动合并，产生<strong>合并冲突（Merge Conflict）</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git merge feature&#10;# CONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in src/config.sh&#10;git status&#10;&#10;cat src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><p>冲突标记格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD&#10;echo &quot;current branch content&quot;&#10;=======&#10;echo &quot;incoming branch content&quot;&#10;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; feature\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"current branch content\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=======</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"incoming branch content\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>>>>>> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">feature</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"vi src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git add src/config.sh&#10;git merge --continue&#10;&#10;git merge --abort\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --abort</span></span></code></pre></div><p>冲突解决工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git mergetool&#10;&#10;git config merge.tool vimdiff&#10;git config mergetool.prompt false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge.tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vimdiff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool.prompt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 频繁地将主分支的更新合并到功能分支（或 rebase），可以减少最终合并时的冲突规模。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"策略选择指南\">策略选择指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{分支已推送?} --&gt;|是| B[merge]&#10;    A --&gt;|否| C{多个提交?}&#10;    C --&gt;|保留细节| D[rebase]&#10;    C --&gt;|压缩为一个| E[squash]&#10;    B --&gt; F{保留分支拓扑?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[merge --no-ff]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[merge --ff]\">graph TD\n    A{分支已推送?} --&gt;|是| B[merge]\n    A --&gt;|否| C{多个提交?}\n    C --&gt;|保留细节| D[rebase]\n    C --&gt;|压缩为一个| E[squash]\n    B --&gt; F{保留分支拓扑?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[merge --no-ff]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[merge --ff]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((合并与变基))&#10;    Merge&#10;      Fast-Forward&#10;      Three-Way&#10;      --no-ff&#10;    Rebase&#10;      线性历史&#10;      黄金法则&#10;      --continue / --abort&#10;    Squash&#10;      压缩提交&#10;      简洁历史&#10;    冲突解决&#10;      冲突标记&#10;      mergetool&#10;      频繁同步\">mindmap\n  root((合并与变基))\n    Merge\n      Fast-Forward\n      Three-Way\n      --no-ff\n    Rebase\n      线性历史\n      黄金法则\n      --continue / --abort\n    Squash\n      压缩提交\n      简洁历史\n    冲突解决\n      冲突标记\n      mergetool\n      频繁同步</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Merge</strong> 保留完整的分支拓扑和历史，是团队协作的安全选择</li>\n<li><strong>Rebase</strong> 生成线性历史但会重写 commit，仅用于未推送的本地分支</li>\n<li><strong>Squash merge</strong> 将整个功能压缩为单次提交，适合保持主分支的简洁性</li>\n<li>冲突解决的核心是理解<strong>三路合并原理</strong>：base、ours、theirs 三个版本的差异比对</li>\n<li>选择策略时需权衡<strong>历史可读性、可追溯性和团队协作安全性</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合并与变基","id":"合并与变基"},{"level":2,"text":"三种整合策略概览","id":"三种整合策略概览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Fast-Forward 与三路合并","id":"fast-forward-与三路合并"},{"level":2,"text":"Rebase 变基","id":"rebase-变基"},{"level":3,"text":"交互式 Rebase","id":"交互式-rebase"},{"level":2,"text":"Squash 合并","id":"squash-合并"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突解决","id":"冲突解决"},{"level":2,"text":"策略选择指南","id":"策略选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分支模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/branching-model"},"next":{"title":"暂存与工作树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/stash-and-worktree"}}